        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"864337a6-c23e-49f1-b47a-5010ba84239a\",\"review_text\":\"Great experience though ads are too frequent\"},{\"review_id\":\"27da0f9d-1977-4f42-93a7-997e132f48c0\",\"review_text\":\"So nice 👍 music 🎵 app\"},{\"review_id\":\"c4cf5200-bc7b-442c-9036-348057f623b5\",\"review_text\":\"I can't set up a new account it just doesn't work\"},{\"review_id\":\"a730d45e-ec12-4f98-83d1-a8f766e6227c\",\"review_text\":\"Best music streaming app\"},{\"review_id\":\"8bd99a6a-47f3-4f61-9bcf-6403edaf887c\",\"review_text\":\"Love this music app thanks Spotify fr the Great music and the special features on there as well thanks u aslot\"},{\"review_id\":\"c20efcd2-41c3-4020-9e26-93a45058f8f9\",\"review_text\":\"Bycot\"},{\"review_id\":\"dfef83ea-794e-4400-94df-ee26919e5719\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever... Do not download by any mistake... Worst quality of music ❌❌❌❌\"},{\"review_id\":\"91132204-877d-4ac1-9d08-20d03f1414f6\",\"review_text\":\"I had to delete and uninstall this app more than one time and I still have the same problem with it it's somehow decides to automatically start playing. Even over other media audio applications plus they keep changing the location of where you can shut off the permissions for that. It's absolutely trash and I would suggest that no one use it because it takes takes over too many permissions on your phone and it really really does spy on your privacy\"},{\"review_id\":\"84b41322-1103-4d20-b246-847f4d34a490\",\"review_text\":\"That so very good apps I love it uwu😍😘💗💑💏\"},{\"review_id\":\"33359b0f-9b76-4c72-b7a3-fe3e8a5327cd\",\"review_text\":\"Latest update \\\"Can't play specific part of the song\\\"totally disappointed\"}]}"
